msgctxt "v26.1-whats-new"
msgid ""
"- [*] POS: Buttons on error, empty and payment result screens now fill the wid"
"th on iPhone and stay at the bottom of the screen. [https://github.com/woocomm"
"erce/woocommerce-ios/pull/18310]\n"
"- [*] POS: Wait for the card reader to reconnect if it disconnects while prepa"
"ring a payment. [https://github.com/woocommerce/woocommerce-ios/pull/18254]\n"
"- [*] POS: Checkout payment buttons stay on screen with large text sizes, and "
"the content above them scrolls. [https://github.com/woocommerce/woocommerce-io"
"s/pull/18305]\n"
"- [Internal] Track receipt printer setup, connection and print Retry analytics"
" events in POS [https://github.com/woocommerce/woocommerce-ios/pull/18251]\n"
"- [*] Push notifications: The app icon badge no longer stays at 1 after a stoc"
"k notification. [https://github.com/woocommerce/woocommerce-ios/pull/18250]\n"
"- [*] Push notifications: The app icon badge now clears when the app returns t"
"o the Orders or Products tab after a push arrived while that tab was open. [ht"
"tps://github.com/woocommerce/woocommerce-ios/pull/18273]\n"
"- [**] POS: Point of Sale is now available on iPhone in the US, Canada, Austra"
"lia and Puerto Rico, and on iOS 18 and later. [https://github.com/woocommerce/"
"woocommerce-ios/pull/18235]\n"
"- [*] POS: Tap to Pay is no longer offered at checkout for stores in Canada, A"
"ustralia and Puerto Rico, where it is not supported. [https://github.com/wooco"
"mmerce/woocommerce-ios/pull/18235]\n"
"- [*] POS: On iPhone, the cart closes when its last item is removed. [https://"
"github.com/woocommerce/woocommerce-ios/pull/18255]\n"
"- [*] POS: On iPhone, tapping a selected coupon in the coupon list now removes"
" it from the cart. [https://github.com/woocommerce/woocommerce-ios/pull/18270]"
"\n"
"- [*] POS: On iPhone, Exit POS is now the last item in the menu. [https://gith"
"ub.com/woocommerce/woocommerce-ios/pull/18268]\n"
"- [*] Help & Support: Troubleshooting now checks your payment setup, so you ca"
"n find and fix card payment problems faster. [https://github.com/woocommerce/w"
"oocommerce-ios/pull/18229]\n"
"- [*] POS: On iPhone, settings, orders and checkout now slide between screens "
"with the standard push animation. [https://github.com/woocommerce/woocommerce-"
"ios/pull/18272]\n"
"- [*] The app no longer tries to create an application password on every reque"
"st after a failure, and logs you out if your store rejects your saved username"
" or password. [https://github.com/woocommerce/woocommerce-ios/pull/18208]\n"
"- [*] Orders: Shipping Details now show the shipping phone. [https://github.co"
"m/woocommerce/woocommerce-ios/pull/18230]\n"
"- [*] POS: On iPhone, Point of Sale uses smaller spacing, paddings and cards, "
"so more products and order details fit on the screen. [https://github.com/wooc"
"ommerce/woocommerce-ios/pull/18256]\n"
"- [*] Products: Preview signs you in to your store when possible, works after "
"logging in with your store username and password, and no longer shows \"Page no"
"t found\" on stores connected without the Jetpack plugin. [https://github.com/w"
"oocommerce/woocommerce-ios/pull/18238]\n"
"- [*] Products: Saving a product with a duplicate SKU now shows a clear error "
"message. [https://github.com/woocommerce/woocommerce-ios/pull/18269]\n"
"- [*] Products: Opening a product that was deleted from the store now says so,"
" for stores connected without Jetpack tunnel. [https://github.com/woocommerce/"
"woocommerce-ios/pull/18269]\n"
"- [*] Products: The Variations list now loads the rest of a product's variatio"
"ns right after a pull to refresh. [https://github.com/woocommerce/woocommerce-"
"ios/pull/18252]\n"
"- [Internal] AI support: Include sanitized recent warning and error logs with "
"new chats for login failures. [https://github.com/woocommerce/woocommerce-ios/"
"pull/18189]\n"
"- [Internal] The app no longer requests the list of REST API routes at launch "
"and on store switch, which reduces launch CPU. [https://github.com/woocommerce"
"/woocommerce-ios/pull/18341]\n"
msgstr ""

